# Keep the live homepage intact

`index.html` and `js/main.js` are the public site. They must stay complete, deployable files.

- Never write `FILE:/...` path stubs, empty files, or placeholder text in their place.
- Do not commit a rewrite unless the result is full HTML/JS (DOCTYPE, real markup, real script).
- After a large edit, confirm `index.html` still starts with `<!DOCTYPE html>` and is tens of kilobytes, not a few dozen bytes.
- GitHub Pages will refuse to deploy if `scripts/check-homepage.py` fails. Do not bypass or delete that check.
